<title>ESTONIA: FARMA CUM-DIVIDEND SHARES TO END.</title>
<headline>FARMA CUM-DIVIDEND SHARES TO END.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Farmaatsiatehas shares are traded cum-dividends for the last day on Thursday, the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Tallinna Farmaatsiatehas shares bought from Friday are ex-dividends, which do not have the right for 1996 dividends, the bourse added in a statement.</p>
<p>Farmaatsiatehas will pay dividends of 1.50 kroons per share. It will fix the share holders list for dividend payments on April 30.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
